<h2>Benefits</h2>
<ul>
    <li>Durable overcoats shield the reflective layer from low-level pitting and erosion.</li>
    <li>Sacrificial-layer approach preserves mirror reflectance and figure over long missions.</li>
    <li>In-space re-coating offers a path to restore surfaces after cumulative impact damage.</li>
    <li>Builds on proven, flight-relevant coating durability.</li>
</ul>
<hr>
<h2>Applications</h2>
<ul>
    <li>Long-duration space telescope mirrors.</li>
